@@ -381,15 +409,24 @@
 #: C/gnumeric.xml:5
 msgid ""
 "<application>Gnumeric</application> is a spreadsheet, a computer program "
-"used to manipulate and analyze numeric data. <application>Gnumeric</"
-"application> can help you keep track of information in lists, organize "
-"numeric values in columns and rows, perform and update complex calculations "
-"by defining each step of the calculation and modifying particular steps "
-"subsequently, create and display or print graphical plots of data using bar "
-"plots, line graphs, pie charts or radar charts, implement complex "
-"optimization modeling or perform many other tasks involving numbers, dates, "
-"times, names or other data."
-msgstr ""
+"used to manipulate and analyze numeric data. "
+"<application>Gnumeric</application> can help you keep track of information "
+"in lists, organize numeric values in columns and rows, perform and update "
+"complex calculations by defining each step of the calculation and modifying "
+"particular steps subsequently, create and display or print graphical plots "
+"of data using bar plots, line graphs, pie charts or radar charts, implement "
+"complex optimization modeling or perform many other tasks involving numbers,"
+" dates, times, names or other data."
+msgstr ""
+"<application>Gnumeric</application> är ett kalkylprogram, ett datorprogram "
+"för att hantera och analysera numeriska data. "
+"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan hjälpa dig att hålla reda på "
+"information i listor, ordna numeriska värden i kolumner och rader, utföra "
+"och uppdatera komplicerade beräkningar genom att definiera varje "
+"beräkningssteg och senare ändra enskilda steg, skapa och visa eller skriva "
+"ut grafiska diagram med stapel-, linje-, cirkeldiagram eller radardiagram, "
+"använda komplicerad optimeringsmodellering eller utföra många andra "
+"uppgifter med tal, datum, tider, namn eller andra data."
 
